      "uncited_sentences": [
        "Tweets are selected through multiple rounds of annotation.",
        "Initially, a classifier (INLINEFORM0) is used to label the data, and then a helper system is employed to label a subset of the data.",
        "Afterward, crowdworkers spot-check the tweets to estimate the frequency of job-related tweets as the confidence score changes.",
        "Based on this, Type-1 and Type-2 tweets are selected for further annotation.",
        "Type-1 tweets are those with high confidence scores, while Type-2 tweets are those with very low confidence scores.",
        "Finally, additional tweets are selected from the job-likely set and those labeled as positive by the helper system but not used in previous rounds for further annotation."
      ]
    }
  }
